Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:46:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2736/3799] soh: rename func_809820E0 -> DemoGt_SpinUpParams24

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: accelerates the params 24 piece's spin up to its kREG-tunable cap
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c
index 538423e57..75b6ef1c8 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Gt/z_demo_gt.c
@@ -1674,7 +1674,8 @@ void DemoGt_PlayBreakSfxParams24(DemoGt* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_809820E0(DemoGt* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809820E0: accelerates the params 24 piece's spin up to its kREG-tunable cap
+void DemoGt_SpinUpParams24(DemoGt* this) {
     f32 temp = this->unk_172;
 
     this->unk_174 = (temp * ((kREG(64) * 0.001f) + 0.048f)) + (kREG(79) + 100.0f);
@@ -1698,7 +1699,7 @@ void DemoGt_Update7(DemoGt* this, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 void DemoGt_Update15(DemoGt* this, PlayState* play) {
-    func_809820E0(this);
+    DemoGt_SpinUpParams24(this);  // was func_809820E0 [LLM:HIGH]
     DemoGt_MoveAndShake(this, play, 9);  // was func_8097ED64 [LLM:HIGH]
     DemoGt_PlayBreakSfxParams24(this, play);  // was func_809820AC [LLM:HIGH]
 }
